  "body": "PRICED WELL UNDER CV - ACT NOW!\r\n\r\nPositioned on a flat, freehold site in the heart of Takapuna, this beautifully presented character villa combines timeless charm, modern comfort and exciting future potential. With the vendor committed to a sale, this is an opportunity not to be missed.\r\n\r\nZoned Residential - Mixed Housing Urban with services available curbside, the property offers exciting development potential for those looking to landbank, redevelop or maximise the value of this prime Takapuna site.\r\n\r\nBathed in natural light from its desirable north-facing aspect, the home showcases classic weatherboard construction, timber flooring and a warm, welcoming feel throughout. The renovated kitchen with scullery adds both style and functionality, ideal for families and entertaining alike.\r\n\r\nDesigned for easy living, the spacious layout offers generous bedrooms, multiple living areas and seamless indoor/outdoor flow to a wrap-around deck - perfect for relaxing or hosting guests. \r\n\r\nA garage and off-street parking add convenience, while the move-in-ready condition allows you to enjoy immediately or explore the site's future potential.\r\n\r\nFeatures include:\r\n* Flat, freehold section\r\n* Double Westlake Zone\r\n* Residential - Mixed Housing Urban Zone\r\n* Services available curbside\r\n* Character weatherboard villa\r\n* Renovated kitchen with scullery\r\n* Timber flooring\r\n* Spacious family-friendly layout\r\n* Wrap-around deck with great indoor/outdoor flow\r\n* Central heating plus two fireplaces\r\n* Fully fenced grounds\r\n* Garage and off-street parking\r\n* North-facing for excellent sun\r\n* Move-in ready or develop the site\r\n* Close to shops, schools and motorway access\r\n\r\nIn zone for Takapuna Normal Intermediate, Westlake Girls' High School, Westlake Boys High School, Takapuna School and Takapuna Grammar School.\r\n\r\nRarely do opportunities like this become available in central Takapuna. The vendor's instructions are clear - this property will be sold.\r\n\r\nhttp://rwmilford.co.nz/MRG34847",
